WEBVTT

00:00:03.299 --> 00:00:06.046
Click Delete on a clip, and confirm.

00:00:06.046 --> 00:00:09.969
The master copy and every provider's copy are removed.

00:00:11.569 --> 00:00:16.099
Queues and phone menus that pointed at the clip fall back to their

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:19.559
spoken text, or to silence, so update them first.

00:00:20.309 --> 00:00:25.291
When you move to another site, voice media entries travel in deployment plans,

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.011
but the audio does not.

00:00:27.011 --> 00:00:31.696
Open each imported clip and upload its audio again; queues and menus that

00:00:31.696 --> 00:00:35.669
use it start playing the new audio as soon as it is uploaded.

